gridctl MCP Python runtime base
==============================

This image and its recipe are provided by the gridctl project under the
Apache License 2.0. See the LICENSE file in the gridctl repository.

This base is a runtime foundation for derived MCP servers. It is not the
Gridctl gateway, and it is not a ready-to-run MCP server.

Third-party components
----------------------

The image starts from the CPython `python:3.12.11-slim-bookworm` distribution
image and installs Debian `tini`. Those components keep their own licenses,
including PSF, Debian package licenses, and tini's MIT license. An SBOM or
`org.opencontainers.image.licenses` label records identifiers; it does not
replace the license texts, notices, or source-offer obligations that apply
when you redistribute this image or a derivative.

Derived application images
